I'm not personally ready to play the game in real-time: I want to
practice both playing the game and speaking Lojban more before I
do this.

Part of what makes e-mail work for me is that I don't have to be
available at the same time other players are--it is quite difficult
for me to block off an hour or so to play a game, but quite easy for
me to participate in an e-mail thread.

I'll include you in the next game!  That makes it you and I so far.

-Alan

